        <activityName xml:lang="en">Wind turbine 2.3MW, onshore, tower, concrete</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Wind turbine 2.3MW, onshore, tower, concrete
UUID=2ee50d97-40ce-3c97-a60f-dc30d0da763c
Wind turbine tower, at site including manufacturing, transports, installation, replacements, decommission and waste treatement. Calculated for FU of 1p.
Data are based on the Enercon E-82 2.3MW onshore wind turbine (Enercon, 2011).
Assumed lifetime is 25 years.
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2ee50d97-40ce-3c97-a60f-dc30d0da763c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
